  "description": "Minecraft but for war! Make awesome weapons such as guns or make military vehicles such as a plane or many tanks.",
  "body": "# We love War!\nWelcome to the world of Minecraft War\nThis Modpack contains many things to aid you in **war**, things such as tanks, planes, and even missiles. Explosion are **3x** as big, and chaos awaits.\nThis mod uses **_Fancy Menu_** and _**Drippy Loading Screen**_ to make the custome guis for the menu\n\n### list of features\n- Guns\n- Vehicles (Tanks, Humvees, plane,and other types of vehicles)\n- Guns\n- Bombs and Missiles \n- New Technology \n- Optimization \n- And their are many upcoming features\n\nMade by **It's Cosmic** and Thanks to **Kiwicatking** for Helping",
